      "text": "RUN_STARTED                         run begins\nTEXT_MESSAGE_CHUNK                  answer tokens\nTOOL_CALL_CHUNK / TOOL_CALL_RESULT  tool step; live label = the tool's status_message argument\nCUSTOM (canvas)                     live canvas edits\nRUN_FINISHED                        token usage · interrupt outcome when a tool waits for approval\nSTATE_SNAPSHOT · MESSAGES_SNAPSHOT  sent before an interrupted RUN_FINISHED (resume support)\nRUN_ERROR                           any exception",
      "originalText": "RUN_STARTED                         run begins\nTEXT_MESSAGE_CHUNK                  answer tokens\nTOOL_CALL_CHUNK / TOOL_CALL_RESULT  tool step; live label = the tool's status_message argument\nCUSTOM (canvas)                     live canvas edits\nRUN_FINISHED                        token usage · interrupt outcome when a tool waits for approval\nSTATE_SNAPSHOT · MESSAGES_SNAPSHOT  sent before an interrupted RUN_FINISHED (resume support)\nRUN_ERROR                           any exception",
      "fontSize": 16,
